      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I verify that a packer and mover in Punjab is IBA‑approved and trustworthy?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Check the mover’s IBA certification number on the Indian Banks Association portal or request a copy of the certificate. Cross‑verify the GSTIN, ISO 9001:2015 accreditation, and read recent Google reviews. A reputable company will also provide a transparent invoice that matches the quoted price and includes insurance details.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a smooth inter‑state shift from Punjab to a major transport hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, original address proof, the e‑Way bill generated for the cargo, and a signed packing list. If the move is corporate‑sponsored, include the company’s authorization letter. Our packers and movers in punjab handle all paperwork, ensuring compliance with GST and transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the 7‑layer packaging system suitable for antique furniture and temple idols?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Layer 1’s moisture‑resistant stretch film protects against humidity, while Layer 2’s heavy‑duty bubble wrap cushions delicate surfaces. Layer 3’s 5‑ply corrugated board adds structural strength, and Layer 4’s high‑density foam guards edges. For high‑value items we add custom wooden crates and IRDAI‑approved marine insurance for extra peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does live GPS tracking improve safety during a Punjab relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each of our 120+ specialized container trucks is equipped with satellite GPS that streams real‑time location to both our control center and the customer portal. This visibility lets you monitor progress, receive alerts for any route deviation, and ensures that the cargo remains on the approved highway corridor, reducing theft and delay risks.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the final price in the Punjab state shifting cost table?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on total volume (cubic feet), distance (≈850 km to the nearest hub), type of goods (household, vehicle, corporate), required packing level (standard vs. premium 7‑layer), and any additional services such as stair‑case handling or temporary storage. Seasonal demand and fuel surcharge may also affect the final quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I schedule a same‑day pickup for urgent moves within Punjab?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, our network of local hubs and 24/7 dispatch teams allows same‑day pickups for urgent relocations, subject to truck availability. When you request an instant quote, indicate the urgency; we’ll allocate a nearby container truck, confirm the loading window, and provide a detailed itinerary within hours.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer insurance for high‑value electronics and jewellery during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI for all items, including electronics and jewellery. The policy covers loss, theft, and accidental damage up to the declared amount. Our team records each item on a detailed inventory, photographs it, and secures it with the 7‑layer packaging before loading onto the truck.</p>
      </div>
